    {
      "id": "u_9a4f4a55bd33d77322a94a8e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since a single note can appear into multiple places in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ via a process called __TRILIUM_PH_2__Cloning Notes__TRILIUM_PH_3__, it's recommended to choose a generalized name that fits into all locations instead of something more specific to avoid confusion.",
      "sourceHash": "9a4f4a55bd33d77322a94a8e231b5d2ba85ac8b794849d304daff166b29bdc8d",
      "context": "Branch prefix",
      "contextHash": "502ac0888c5587a395120df37f01697692fb768346ceccf52dc06d90e6c10805",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "1つのノートが __TRILIUM_PH_0__ノートツリー__TRILIUM_PH_1__ と呼ばれるプロセスによって複数の場所に存在できるため、混乱を避けるために、特定の場所だけに特化したものではなく、すべての場所に適した一般的な名前を選択することをお勧めします。 __TRILIUM_PH_2__クローン__TRILIUM_PH_3__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-16T11:52:29.295Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a42abef7859f889a78c15d91_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In some cases this isn't possible so Trilium provides \"branch prefixes\", which is shown before the note name in the tree and as such provides a specific kind of context.",
      "sourceHash": "a42abef7859f889a78c15d915922af08462c4399e6b973ddc85dadba04cbcfda",
      "context": "Branch prefix",
      "contextHash": "502ac0888c5587a395120df37f01697692fb768346ceccf52dc06d90e6c10805",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "場合によってはこれが不可能なため、Triliumには「ブランチプレフィックス」が用意されています。これはツリー内のノート名の前に表示され、特定の種類Контекстを提供します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T16:50:34.717Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f1e1d56f9786c0cb0ff04439_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The prefix is location-specific, so it's displayed only in the note tree.",
      "sourceHash": "f1e1d56f9786c0cb0ff04439492e0d2f5a81b0b6113717db177df79a049bb534",
      "context": "Branch prefix",
      "contextHash": "502ac0888c5587a395120df37f01697692fb768346ceccf52dc06d90e6c10805",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "プレフィックスは場所固有のものであるため、ノートツリーにのみ表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
